Design System Architecture Backlog

1. System Components

Sensors: Detect when people enter or leave the bus.

Raspberry Pi: Reads the sensors and keeps track of the passenger count.

Backend/API: Receives data and checks the bus capacity.

Database: Stores passenger counts and sensor events.

Front-end App: Displays the current number of passengers and crowd status.

Alarm: Alerts the driver when the bus is over capacity.

2. System Architecture

[Door Sensors]

       ↓

[Raspberry Pi]

       ↓

[Backend API]

       ↓

[Database]

       ↓

