       ↓

[Passenger Count / Crowd Level]

[Raspberry Pi] → [Alarm]

3. Key Technical Decisions

Controller: Raspberry Pi

Sensors: IR break-beam sensors

Occupancy calculation: Raspberry Pi

Data updates: Whenever someone enters or leaves

Database data: Bus ID, timestamp, IN/OUT event, passenger count

Alarm: Activated when passenger count reaches or exceeds capacity

